          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ras-Tabahn",
            text: _("What happened here, I wonder. Well, no matter. What was bad for these families is good for us. I will animate them, and you will attack. Practice both freezing and life force attacks. You may each choose one soldier from our army for protection, and I will call it up for you. After that, I will not help. I intend most of you to survive this battle, so try not to die."),
